# Eclipsed Realms: "As this land enters, choose Elemental, Elf, Faerie, Giant, Goblin, Kithkin, Merfolk, or Treefolk"
# (CR 614.12a) - Human is not among them (the refusal) - and "{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast
# a spell of the chosen type or activate an ability of a source of the chosen type" (CR 106.6, 607.2a). Elemental chosen,
# its {R} on turn 1, the only mana, can't cast Lightning Bolt. Turn 3 its {G} and the Forest's cast Bramble Familiar, an
# Elemental spell; turn 5 they pay the Familiar's "{1}{G}, {T}, Discard a card: Return this creature to its owner's hand",
# an ability of an Elemental source. Turn 7 "{T}: Add {C}" adds plain {C}.

